WEBVTT

00:02.400 --> 00:06.740
Time to atone for your sin,
Prince Marse.

00:08.240 --> 00:10.910
Do so, and you shall have
His Majesty's forgiveness

00:10.910 --> 00:13.160
and win back the princess you love.

00:13.870 --> 00:15.870
Who are you?

00:15.870 --> 00:17.790
A spy from the empire?

00:19.870 --> 00:23.000
I am just a normal seer.

00:23.290 --> 00:25.260
I can see your future

00:25.260 --> 00:27.720
thanks to my divination.

00:27.720 --> 00:28.470
However,

00:29.090 --> 00:32.430
my divination is usually very accurate.

00:32.430 --> 00:34.810
The last monster attack
was a good example.

00:36.680 --> 00:40.520
The Ring King is an outsider
from a different world.

00:40.520 --> 00:43.440
He is not meant to linger in this world.

00:43.980 --> 00:48.150
You were the one worthy
of becoming the Ring King.

00:48.610 --> 00:50.860
I don't see why you should be concerned.

00:52.070 --> 00:53.250
Or perhaps...

00:53.660 --> 00:56.540
...you wish to go against
His Majesty's will?

01:02.580 --> 01:05.920
This sword is capable of
altering the flow of mana.

01:05.920 --> 01:09.630
It's an ancient weapon
sung in legends and tales.

01:10.220 --> 01:12.590
I'll give it to you.

01:12.590 --> 01:15.510
Despite not having any special abilities,

01:15.510 --> 01:18.890
you can defeat the Ring King
with this sword.

01:19.180 --> 01:21.360
Why can you possess this weapon?

01:32.030 --> 01:35.830
I certainly hope you bring
the rings back home.

01:35.830 --> 01:37.660
I'll be waiting.

01:50.720 --> 01:58.260
TALES OF WEDDING RINGS

03:22.420 --> 03:24.390
What is wrong with me?

03:26.690 --> 03:31.690
After all the effort I've put into you,
you can't even handle a border country?

03:32.360 --> 03:36.240
Do you know
what the officials think of you?

03:36.730 --> 03:38.400
They see you as a living failure!

03:39.370 --> 03:42.780
A new Ring King will be selected soon.

03:43.260 --> 03:46.100
It is just a moldy old tale

03:46.580 --> 03:49.930
but it serves as a great way
to earn people's trust.

03:50.630 --> 03:54.260
I trust you won't fail
a task as simple as this.

03:54.830 --> 03:57.340
You are only valuable
because you're my son.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.260
That's all there is to it.

04:00.530 --> 04:03.930
Show me your worth, Marmarugias.

04:30.190 --> 04:34.330
I really lost everything...

04:38.390 --> 04:41.240
What should I do?

04:53.010 --> 04:54.060
That's right.

04:54.860 --> 04:58.530
This is the only way left for me.

05:04.400 --> 05:08.450
We are launching a campaign
against the monster.

05:08.990 --> 05:11.040
Are you sure I should stay?

05:11.370 --> 05:13.390
The campaign is not your responsibility.

05:14.090 --> 05:15.960
When a single unit gets too powerful,

05:15.960 --> 05:18.210
the pacing of the entire army
will be disrupted.

05:18.580 --> 05:23.930
You exist as a last resort
when push comes to shove.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.730
Take care of this place.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.030
Yes.

05:40.960 --> 05:42.180
Satou!

05:43.480 --> 05:47.580
Well... You know...

05:48.350 --> 05:49.130
What is it?

05:50.910 --> 05:51.960
Whatever!

05:56.430 --> 05:59.750
If you have to go into battle,

05:59.750 --> 06:01.060
at least you'll be ready.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.360
Thanks.

06:04.300 --> 06:06.230
Don't be so bashful.
It's embarrassing.

06:06.230 --> 06:09.600
Well, I'm still not used to this.

06:09.600 --> 06:12.600
Allow me to lend you
my strength as well!

06:14.010 --> 06:15.650
Hold on! Granart!

06:17.000 --> 06:18.110
What?

06:18.110 --> 06:20.440
I'm his wife too.

06:20.440 --> 06:22.280
Is it wrong for us to kiss?

06:22.780 --> 06:25.430
No! But that doesn't mean...!

06:25.430 --> 06:26.370
Um...!

06:26.370 --> 06:27.820
Then I...

06:27.820 --> 06:29.120
Not you too, Nephrites!

06:29.490 --> 06:31.200
Is that a no?

06:31.500 --> 06:34.060
No... I'm not saying you can't...

06:34.790 --> 06:35.750
Then...

06:38.380 --> 06:41.340
Nephrites is actually
so enthused for once.

06:41.590 --> 06:44.260
All right, I get to do it again!

06:44.260 --> 06:46.140
That's cheating, Princess Krystal!

06:48.890 --> 06:50.140
What is going on here?

06:50.140 --> 06:52.850
This is ridiculous beyond any words.

06:52.850 --> 06:56.060
The bond with the Ring King
serves as the power source.

06:56.060 --> 06:58.900
They're willing to share their power
with the Ring King.

06:58.900 --> 07:01.320
Isn't that a good thing?

07:01.320 --> 07:03.320
Is that so?

07:20.400 --> 07:21.390
Report!

07:21.390 --> 07:24.350
We are advancing smoothly
on the right and left flanks.

07:24.860 --> 07:25.720
I see.

07:26.040 --> 07:29.930
The monster army is somehow
acting the way our seer predicted.

07:30.280 --> 07:33.020
At this rate,
victory will be ours for sure.

07:33.390 --> 07:34.520
Prince Sluder!

07:35.210 --> 07:38.730
A giant monster showed up
at the most unexpected location!

07:38.730 --> 07:41.860
It will breach Maasa Palace soon!

07:42.360 --> 07:45.150
Please dispatch a troop to the palace!

07:45.150 --> 07:47.950
No. We will defend this place.

07:48.890 --> 07:50.590
The palace will do fine without us.

07:53.750 --> 07:54.590
What's going on?

07:55.160 --> 07:55.910
Hurry!

07:56.250 --> 07:57.740
Into the palace!

08:01.800 --> 08:02.710
A monster!

08:05.840 --> 08:08.230
It seems there's only one.

08:17.180 --> 08:17.940
Satou!

08:23.440 --> 08:24.650
Mr. Marse?!

08:25.490 --> 08:26.850
Ring King...

08:26.850 --> 08:29.890
I'm sorry, but you must die here now!

08:32.370 --> 08:33.190
Oh, no!

08:33.590 --> 08:35.200
I'll take care of the monster!

08:38.159 --> 08:40.039
Satou, you must deal with Marse!

08:42.390 --> 08:43.330
Mr. Marse!

08:44.090 --> 08:45.210
What's going on?

08:45.550 --> 08:47.430
Kill the Ring King...

08:47.430 --> 08:49.300
...and bring the rings home.

08:49.970 --> 08:53.260
Such is my mission
as the empire's prince.

08:54.180 --> 08:55.510
At this point,

08:55.810 --> 08:58.230
it's the only thing I can do!

08:58.640 --> 08:59.520
Wait!

09:00.830 --> 09:02.520
What's your reason for doing this?!

09:02.520 --> 09:03.770
Tell me about it!

09:04.150 --> 09:05.770
You told me...

09:06.170 --> 09:07.690
If it's important,

09:08.120 --> 09:09.430
we should just take it!

09:11.230 --> 09:15.400
I became your guide
and earned your trust

09:15.400 --> 09:17.330
for this very moment.

09:18.400 --> 09:19.790
For the sake of the empire,

09:20.290 --> 09:22.000
you must fall!

09:22.370 --> 09:23.530
Satou!

09:23.530 --> 09:25.090
Marse is not acting like himself.

09:26.170 --> 09:28.050
I fear he's being manipulated.

09:28.550 --> 09:30.550
Then what should I do now?

09:30.550 --> 09:32.470
Will holy water turn him back to normal?

09:32.470 --> 09:34.050
How should I know?!

09:34.050 --> 09:35.010
That being said,

09:35.010 --> 09:36.930
you must stop him.

09:37.260 --> 09:41.020
Gramps! Why do you always
get so useless when I need you?

09:43.390 --> 09:46.610
There's no way I can defeat him
with just my sword.

09:47.570 --> 09:48.820
In that case...

09:53.530 --> 09:55.090
How is this happening?

09:55.090 --> 09:56.270
Interesting.

09:57.740 --> 10:00.370
A sword that alters the flow of mana.

10:00.370 --> 10:02.220
He's holding a nostalgic weapon.

10:03.100 --> 10:06.250
Who would've thought that piece of trash
could wield this sword?

10:06.910 --> 10:08.050
However,

10:08.050 --> 10:11.310
it suits that worthless
young man very well.

10:11.310 --> 10:12.710
I knew it.

10:12.710 --> 10:14.800
The ring is talking to me.

10:15.090 --> 10:16.930
No need to hesitate.

10:16.930 --> 10:19.390
With the power of the rings,
you can come out on top.

10:19.940 --> 10:21.930
Turn him into a pile of ashes.

10:22.970 --> 10:25.010
I can never do that!

10:25.010 --> 10:26.650
Would you rather get killed?

10:27.050 --> 10:28.570
Shut it! You talk too much!

10:28.570 --> 10:30.190
I told you, I can't do it!

10:30.480 --> 10:34.390
Why would you hesitate to defeat a foe
with your own power?

10:34.910 --> 10:36.110
What a fool.

10:37.120 --> 10:39.450
That's true enough,
but how do I pull it off?

10:39.930 --> 10:43.790
If I use my full power,
I could perish him as the ring said.

10:43.790 --> 10:46.750
But Marse isn't an opponent
I can win by pulling punches.

10:48.350 --> 10:51.370
Yeah. I've never defeated him.

10:52.190 --> 10:53.040
So,

10:53.770 --> 10:56.020
why am I still unscathed?

11:02.440 --> 11:03.690
I knew it.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.600
Mr. Marse never changes.

11:07.310 --> 11:09.610
Satou is fighting Mr. Marse?!

11:09.900 --> 11:11.030
Why?

11:11.030 --> 11:12.310
No idea.

11:12.310 --> 11:14.280
Marse wants to steal the rings.

11:28.290 --> 11:30.340
That fool!
He's going to die!

11:34.640 --> 11:36.190
I knew it.

11:36.710 --> 11:40.350
You couldn't bring yourself to kill me.

11:42.640 --> 11:45.700
That's because you have a kind heart.

11:57.310 --> 12:00.510
Kill me, Satou.

12:02.180 --> 12:04.010
I was abandoned by my lover.

12:04.570 --> 12:08.210
I'm a failure who can't
fulfill my duty as a prince.

12:09.490 --> 12:13.550
I even hurt you.

12:14.820 --> 12:17.590
I am utterly worthless now.

12:18.970 --> 12:21.470
I quite like you, Mr. Marse.

12:23.040 --> 12:26.010
Honestly, without you,

12:26.010 --> 12:28.130
I would've died by now.

12:28.680 --> 12:33.110
I've made it this far
because your kindness saved me.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.670
If you think yourself worthless,

12:37.210 --> 12:39.280
I'll make you priceless.

12:40.640 --> 12:44.520
You're the comrade of a legendary hero
who will save the world.

12:44.520 --> 12:46.740
Nothing can be more valuable than that.

12:48.220 --> 12:51.250
I need you.

12:51.670 --> 12:54.400
You want me to become...

12:55.250 --> 12:57.050
Crush the gem at the hilt.

13:05.970 --> 13:09.230
They are all just useless!

13:10.520 --> 13:12.440
My magic won't hold for long!

13:18.360 --> 13:19.360
Crap!

13:19.660 --> 13:21.320
Hime!

13:31.040 --> 13:31.870
Saphira!

13:41.180 --> 13:43.220
Is it taking her as a hostage?!

13:43.880 --> 13:48.390
You ruined the gift I gave you,
Prince Marse.

13:49.220 --> 13:52.640
I knew it.
You are with the monsters.

13:52.640 --> 13:56.320
It was you who put
the curse on that sword.

13:56.640 --> 14:00.110
Divination isn't an impressive art.

14:00.110 --> 14:02.220
I merely unshackled the heart

14:02.220 --> 14:05.130
and made his desire burn stronger.

14:05.660 --> 14:09.200
You know that very well, Prince Marse.

14:11.210 --> 14:14.840
If you do anything strange,
Princess Saphira will die.

14:14.840 --> 14:18.620
Well? Will you trade
the rings for her life?

14:21.010 --> 14:22.050
You're right.

14:22.490 --> 14:24.260
I envy Satou.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.500
I even thought about taking his life.

14:27.350 --> 14:28.260
However,

14:28.570 --> 14:30.180
that's not all of me.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.890
Satou risked his life
to make me realize that.

14:34.950 --> 14:36.270
Mr. Marse...

14:36.610 --> 14:39.360
I won't hesitate anymore.

14:40.750 --> 14:42.190
I will live for myself

14:42.690 --> 14:44.910
and for those I cherish.

14:46.010 --> 14:48.090
I'll walk my own path.

14:49.000 --> 14:50.660
That's my worth.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.000
Princess Saphira!

14:54.120 --> 14:57.080
Please marry me!

15:02.870 --> 15:04.880
Have you lost your mind?

15:07.220 --> 15:08.390
Eat this!

15:14.570 --> 15:17.820
It's cheating to say that now,
Prince Marse.

15:18.770 --> 15:21.480
Sorry for the wait.

15:22.990 --> 15:25.730
Curse you!

15:35.350 --> 15:39.770
I was hoping to have fun with you
before the King fully awakens.

15:39.770 --> 15:43.920
But I'm tired of playing by your rules!

15:44.570 --> 15:46.760
Return to the abyss!

15:47.590 --> 15:49.340
What is this thing?!

15:49.650 --> 15:52.010
She finally shows her true nature.

15:53.270 --> 15:54.560
Unbelievable.

15:55.570 --> 15:58.170
You really are a fool.

15:58.170 --> 15:59.750
You're too kind.

16:00.440 --> 16:03.060
But you're a nice fool.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.650
What...?

16:22.790 --> 16:26.720
The power of this ring
commands the source of life.

16:28.300 --> 16:32.140
Witness the true power of the Dragonkin!

16:39.520 --> 16:41.100
She devoured the monster!

16:53.730 --> 16:55.580
She escaped.

16:57.310 --> 16:58.960
Amazing...

16:59.740 --> 17:02.630
Can you still turn back to normal?

17:08.260 --> 17:09.800
Of course.

17:12.950 --> 17:13.950
Don't look.

17:17.310 --> 17:18.270
Satou.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.420
I'm sorry.

17:21.420 --> 17:23.980
But let's finish
what we started earlier.

17:32.500 --> 17:35.740
Thank you for saving Maasa.

17:37.050 --> 17:37.930
Who is that dude?

17:38.360 --> 17:39.840
My father.

17:39.840 --> 17:41.080
Huh?!

17:41.480 --> 17:45.160
I was bewitched
by the Abyss King's knight,

17:45.160 --> 17:47.090
but I haven't missed a thing.

17:47.550 --> 17:51.800
The Ring King and his legendary
power are all real.

17:52.350 --> 17:54.070
As a Ring Kingdom,

17:54.070 --> 17:56.890
Maasa will provide you
with full support.

17:56.890 --> 17:59.270
T-Thank you very much!

17:59.570 --> 18:01.810
Heroes from the empire,

18:01.810 --> 18:04.600
thank you for defending Maasa.

18:04.940 --> 18:09.920
But from now on,
the Kingdom of Water will defend itself.

18:09.920 --> 18:13.860
I was too stubborn and believed
I had to protect the kingdom myself.

18:13.860 --> 18:16.160
And I let it fall into the villain's hand.

18:16.910 --> 18:21.100
But with an ally
as powerful as the empire,

18:21.670 --> 18:24.750
I won't make the same mistake.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.950
That's wonderful.

18:26.950 --> 18:30.670
We will rush to your aid
should the need arise.

18:31.410 --> 18:33.300
Please call us with your will.

18:38.850 --> 18:42.000
You went through a lot, Saphir.

18:45.490 --> 18:48.940
It seems she also has a candid side, huh?

18:49.690 --> 18:52.440
You managed to find yourself
a great husband.

18:53.420 --> 18:54.520
Huh?

18:55.550 --> 18:58.790
He is just a fool with magic power.

18:59.210 --> 19:02.690
You're still as bad
at judging characters.

19:02.690 --> 19:04.290
I-Is that so?

19:07.310 --> 19:08.130
Water King.

19:08.550 --> 19:11.590
As the Ring King's knight, Marmarugias,

19:11.590 --> 19:13.480
I have a request to make.

19:14.620 --> 19:17.090
Allow me to marry Princess Saphira.

19:17.490 --> 19:18.690
Prince Marse...

19:19.090 --> 19:21.770
No, I should call you Knight Marse now.

19:22.470 --> 19:25.730
From the day you left until Saphir
made me come to my senses,

19:25.730 --> 19:28.480
I had never paid attention
to Saphira's feelings.

19:29.230 --> 19:33.670
I cared too much about the nation,
and my daughters suffered for it.

19:34.170 --> 19:36.780
I've failed as their father.

19:38.310 --> 19:40.830
I leave her in your capable hands.

19:43.210 --> 19:43.820
Yes!

19:45.830 --> 19:46.830
Princess Saphira.

19:47.230 --> 19:48.580
Prince Marse.

19:54.730 --> 19:56.960
How nice...

19:59.880 --> 20:03.710
I want to be like them.

20:07.830 --> 20:08.730
Satou.

20:10.630 --> 20:11.900
I got ahead of you.

20:12.340 --> 20:14.780
What does that mean?

20:15.350 --> 20:17.450
We got married first...

20:20.590 --> 20:21.580
Could it be...?!

20:22.140 --> 20:23.910
They've done it!

20:27.870 --> 20:28.870
Brother!

20:30.030 --> 20:34.630
That seer, her monsters,
and their connection with the empire...

20:35.360 --> 20:38.430
A conspiracy is brewing
where I can't see.

20:39.070 --> 20:41.430
I must return to the capital at once.

20:43.180 --> 20:45.470
You must come home someday.

20:47.350 --> 20:48.600
I'll be waiting for you.

20:50.090 --> 20:50.970
Yes.

20:57.190 --> 21:00.610
You failed to take Maasa.

21:00.950 --> 21:02.250
Yes.

21:02.250 --> 21:05.420
It was under the empire's control
for a while.

21:06.190 --> 21:08.210
But that cursed girl...

21:08.570 --> 21:14.040
However, a puny nation like that
means nothing to Your Majesty.

21:14.860 --> 21:20.090
As long as I still command the monsters
and we work together,

21:20.090 --> 21:23.390
we can conquer more kingdoms.

21:23.720 --> 21:27.620
Yes. You can accomplish that.

21:28.540 --> 21:30.440
Show me your desire.

21:38.640 --> 21:41.610
You'd come after me
now that Maasa is useless to you?

21:42.370 --> 21:46.190
I only listened to you
because our interests align.

21:46.190 --> 21:48.790
It seems the obsolete
can't be trusted after all.

21:49.160 --> 21:50.500
Darn you!

21:50.500 --> 21:52.120
So you knew it all along?!

21:52.670 --> 21:55.930
We don't live in the age of gods.
It's the age of men!

21:56.510 --> 21:59.380
I will eradicate
anyone who stands in my way.

22:00.150 --> 22:02.930
Whether it's the Abyss King...

22:06.730 --> 22:09.230
...or the Ring King.
